    "web-sdk-ui-toggle-declaration-runtime-mismatch-32b623905b": {
      "kind": "input-contract",
      "en": {
        "reason": "Published UI 4.23.0 types declare the component override as Partial<ToggleSettingsPanelItem> (the component class), producing lifecycle methods and readonly event accessors as configuration paths. At runtime component overrides are copied into constructor config, not onto the component instance, so setting this path is not a supported way to invoke or replace that instance API.",
        "action": "Keep the row and report the exact declaration/runtime mismatch rather than removing it to improve the percentage. Expose legitimate component runtime actions through a separate instance API inspector where useful. A corrected configuration contract requires an SDK type correction; do not claim constructor-config support from an ignored property."
      },
      "ja": {
        "reason": "公開型が設定型ではなくコンポーネント本体を参照しています。生成されたメソッド・読み取り専用イベントのパスは設定値として適用されません。",
        "action": "この行を残して型と適用経路の違いを示します。必要なインスタンス操作は別の操作GUIから提供します。設定オブジェクトに入れても使われない値を設定対応として加点しません。"
      },
      "references": [
        "https://github.com/bitmovin/bitmovin-player-ui/blob/v4.23.0/src/ts/UIComponentConfigOverrides.ts#L493"
      ]
    },
